abel/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/deployments","created_at":"2014-09-28T13:38:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:47:49Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T20:47:45Z","git_url":"git://github.com/babel/babel.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:babel/babel.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/babel/babel.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/babel/babel","homepage":"https://babel.dev","size":137073,"stargazers_count":43814,"watchers_count":43814,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":5790,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":777,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["ast","babel","compiler","es2015","es6","flavortown","javascript"],"visibility":"public","forks":5790,"open_issues":777,"watchers":43814,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"I initially found an issue with webpack's module system. I reported that issue here https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/4753.\r\n\r\nI asked on the babel slack channel which behavior was correct, and @loganfsmyth said:\r\n\r\n> Looks like they are both a little wrong.\r\n>\r\n> ```\r\n> function foo(){}\r\n> export {foo};\r\n> ```\r\n> and\r\n>\r\n> ```\r\n> export function foo(){}\r\n> ```\r\n> should both export foo before processing the imported modules. Functions declaration bindings are initialized with their values before evaluating their imported modules.\r\n\r\n### Input Code\r\n\r\nfoo.js\r\n```js\r\nimport {bar} from \"./bar\";\r\nfunction foo() {}\r\nexport {foo}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected Behavior\r\n```js\r\n\"use strict\";\r\n\r\nObject.defineProperty(exports, \"__esModule\", {\r\n  value: true\r\n});\r\nexports.foo = foo; // <--- foo should be exported before import\r\n\r\nvar _bar = require(\"./bar\");\r\n\r\nfunction foo() {}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Current Behavior\r\n\r\n```js\r\n\"use strict\";\r\n\r\nObject.defineProperty(exports, \"__esModule\", {\r\n  value: true\r\n});\r\nexports.foo = undefined; // <--- foo is not undefined\r\n\r\nvar _bar = require(\"./bar\");\r\n\r\nfunction foo() {}\r\nexports.foo = foo; // <--- foo is defined after the import\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Context\r\nIf I change my code to this I get the \"Expected Behavior\":\r\n```js\r\nimport {bar} from \"./bar\";\r\nexport function foo() {}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe original issue deals with circular dependencies. As such, I also have bar.js:\r\n```js\r\nimport {foo} from \"./foo\";\r\nconsole.log(foo);\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Your Environment\r\n<!--- Include as many relevant details about the environment you experienced the bug in -->\r\n\r\n| software         | version(s)\r\n| ---------------- | -------\r\n| Babel            |  6.24.1 & REPL\r\n| node             | 7.8.0\r\n| npm              | 4.2.0\r\n| Operating System | Mac OS 10.11.6 \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/issues/5654/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel/issues/5654/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"zorro-fr24","id":7267001,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNjcwMDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7267001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24","html_url":"https://github.com/zorro-fr24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro-fr24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-04-25T09:00:42Z","updated_at":"2017-04-25T09:00:42Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"u